on pick orders, report, limit
 put every item of orders whose amount > limit and it's paid into big
 put the first item of orders whose length > 1 into wide
 put the last word of report whose it begins with "a" into last
 put the third line of report whose it is not empty into third
 put every item of report delimited by ";" whose it is not empty into fields
 put the tenth item of line 2 of report delimited by ";" whose it > limit into tenth
 put every code point of report whose it is not " " into points
 return every item of orders whose (every item of it whose it > limit) is not empty
end pick
